# Real local/deploy environment file — was previously tracked (contained
# only PUBLIC CONFIG values: project ref/URL/publishable key, confirmed via
# full git-history review, no server secret ever present), now untracked
# going forward per env-hygiene audit. Use .env.test.example as the
# variable-name template; never re-add this file with `git add -f`.
.env
.env.test
.env.qa

